#N canvas 20 20 1600 1300 12;
#X text 20 20 c_voice -- one drum pad's sample \, played from memory. It loads samples/drums/NN.wav beside the patch at load \, NN its pad \, and plays it from the start on every hit \, so a hit cuts the one before as a one-shot pad on the 404 did. ref/module/sequencer.md, f 70;
#X text 20 140 creation arg 1: its pad \, 1 to 16. arg 2: c_kit's \$0 \, for the count of samples loaded. inlet: a velocity \, 0 to 127 \, 0 ignored. outlet~: the sample \, mono., f 70;
#X obj 20 700 inlet;
#X obj 700 240 loadbang;
#X obj 700 280 t b b;
#X msg 900 320 0;
#X obj 700 320 f \$1;
#X obj 700 360 makefilename samples/drums/%02d.wav;
#X obj 700 400 list prepend dir 0;
#X obj 700 440 list trim;
#X obj 700 480 pdcontrol;
#X obj 700 520 t s s;
#X obj 850 600 symbol;
#X obj 700 560 file isfile;
#X obj 700 600 sel 1;
#X obj 700 640 t b b;
#X obj 850 640 list append \$0-smp;
#X msg 850 680 read -resize \$1 \$2;
#X obj 850 720 soundfiler;
#X obj 850 760 t f f;
#X obj 1000 800 / 44.1;
#X obj 1000 840 t f f f;
#X obj 1150 880 + 10;
#X obj 850 920 pack f f;
#X obj 400 980 list append;
#X msg 700 700 1;
#X obj 700 740 t f f;
#X obj 20 760 spigot;
#X obj 780 780 s \$2-loaded;
#X obj 20 800 moses 1;
#X obj 120 840 t b b f;
#X obj 300 880 expr pow(10 \, 1.5 * (\$f1 / 127 - 1));
#X obj 300 920 pack f f;
#X msg 300 960 0 2 \, \$1 1 2 \, 0 3 \$2;
#X msg 400 1020 0 0 2 \, \$1 \$2 2;
#X obj 400 1060 vline~;
#X obj 300 1060 vline~;
#X obj 400 1100 tabread4~ \$0-smp;
#X obj 400 1140 *~;
#X obj 400 1180 outlet~;
#X obj 120 880 t b b;
#X msg 20 960 1;
#X obj 120 920 f;
#X obj 120 960 del;
#X msg 120 1000 0;
#X obj 20 1040 switch~;
#X obj 1200 240 array define \$0-smp;
#X text 1100 380 The path is the patch's own folder's \, so the Mac's main-dev.pd and the device find the samples the same way. file isfile first: a missing sample is no error \, just a silent pad \, and nothing reaches the console the deploy check reads., f 50;
#X text 520 840 A hit: the level ramps to 0 in 2 ms \, the read jumps to the start 2 ms in \, then the level comes back in 1 ms and falls to 0 over the last 3 ms. The 2 ms keeps a retrigger from clicking. Velocity is 30 dB of range \, even steps in dB: 127 is 0 dB and 16 about -26., f 50;
#X text 20 1100 switch~ keeps a voice's DSP off except while it sounds: a voice costs about 0.65% of the Organelle's core while on (Reference \, Organelle page)., f 34;
